config APKTRACE
    tristate "APK behavioral tracing"
    depends on TRACEPOINTS && PROC_FS
    default m
    help
      Kernel module for Android app behavioral tracing.
      Hooks into syscall entry/exit, process lifecycle, and
      exposes /proc/apktrace for userspace reads.
      Controlled via /proc/apktrace_ctl for adding/removing traced UIDs.
